{
    "version": 1,
    "note": "The single source of test zones (PLAN3 P1.4). A zone is an index over existing directories: it never moves a test. Leaf zones own src[] and tests[] (repo-relative, files or directories, never nested across leaves); `core` is an aggregator of its sub-zones. uses[] = zones whose change affects this one's tests (the Composer graph for packages, a coarse leaf graph inside core). `suite` is the tests/suites.json suite a leaf runs in. `explicit` = never pulled in as a consumer, selected only when touched directly. harness[] = paths whose change means \"run the whole affected set\" (scripts/test-select.php exits 2); database[] = engine-dependent tests (P1.5; the union of the database lists of every packages/*/tests/groups.php, kept equal by tests/Repo/TestGroupsTest.php); tail[] = glob allowlist of prose paths that need no test. This map proves the classification of every source root and test file is complete \u2014 not that uses[] is the true dependency graph.",
